"        The user is solely responsible for:\n"
"        "

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:121
msgid "Mantener la confidencialidad de sus credenciales de acceso."
msgstr "Maintaining the confidentiality of their access credentials."

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:122
msgid "Todas las actividades realizadas bajo su cuenta."
msgstr "All activities carried out under their account."

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:123
msgid "Notificar a SPACE CHEER de inmediato ante cualquier uso no autorizado."
msgstr "Notifying SPACE CHEER immediately of any unauthorized use."

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:124
msgid "Proporcionar información veraz y mantenerla actualizada."
msgstr "Providing truthful information and keeping it up to date."

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:127
msgid ""
"\n"
"        SPACE CHEER se reserva el derecho de suspender o cancelar cuentas "
"que incumplan estos T&C,\n"
"        proporcionen información falsa o realicen actividades que "
"perjudiquen a otros usuarios o a la Plataforma.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        SPACE CHEER reserves the right to suspend or cancel accounts that "
"violate these T&C,\n"
"        provide false information, or engage in activities that harm other "
"users or the Platform.\n"
"        "

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:133
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Los usuarios con rol HEADCOACH son responsables de gestionar "
"correctamente los miembros de su equipo,\n"
"        incluyendo la asignación de roles y el control de acceso a la "
"información del equipo.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Users with the HEADCOACH role are responsible for properly managing "
"their team's members,\n"
"        including role assignment and access control over the team's "
"information.\n"
"        "

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:142
msgid "Pedidos de Uniformes: Proceso, Pagos y Cancelaciones"
msgstr "Uniform Orders: Process, Payments, and Cancellations"

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:144
msgid "Proceso de pedido"
msgstr "Order process"

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:146
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Los pedidos de uniformes siguen un flujo definido de estados:\n"
"        <strong class=\"sc-color-light\">BORRADOR → PENDIENTE → DISEÑO "
"APROBADO → EN PRODUCCIÓN → ENTREGADO</strong>.\n"
"        El pedido puede cancelarse antes de que entre en producción.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Uniform orders follow a defined flow of statuses:\n"
"        <strong class=\"sc-color-light\">DRAFT → PENDING → DESIGN APPROVED → "
"IN PRODUCTION → DELIVERED</strong>.\n"
"        The order can be cancelled before it enters production.\n"
"        "

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:153
msgid ""
"Las medidas de los atletas deben registrarse dentro del plazo indicado por "
"el HEADCOACH."
msgstr ""
"Athletes' measurements must be recorded within the deadline set by the "
"HEADCOACH."

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:154
msgid ""
"Una vez aprobado el diseño, las medidas quedan bloqueadas y no pueden "
"modificarse."
msgstr ""
"Once the design is approved, measurements are locked and cannot be modified."

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:155
msgid ""
"El usuario recibirá notificaciones por correo electrónico en cada cambio de "
"estado."
msgstr "The user will receive email notifications for every status change."

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:158
#: .\templates\orders\admin\order_detail.html:130
msgid "Pagos"
msgstr "Payments"

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:160
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Los precios de los uniformes y productos se muestran en pesos "
"mexicanos (MXN) e incluyen IVA\n"
"        cuando aplique. Los métodos de pago disponibles y las condiciones de "
"pago se especificarán en\n"
"        cada pedido. SPACE CHEER no almacena datos de tarjetas de crédito o "
"débito.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Prices for uniforms and products are shown in Mexican pesos (MXN) "
"and include VAT\n"
"        when applicable. Available payment methods and payment terms will be "
"specified for\n"
"        each order. SPACE CHEER does not store credit or debit card data.\n"
"        "

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:167
msgid "Cancelaciones"
msgstr "Cancellations"

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:169
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Las cancelaciones solo se aceptan antes de que el pedido entre en "
"estado\n"
"        <strong class=\"sc-color-light\">EN PRODUCCIÓN</strong>. Una vez "
"iniciada la producción,\n"
"        no se aceptarán cancelaciones ni reembolsos, salvo defecto de "
"fabricación comprobable.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Cancellations are only accepted before the order enters the\n"
"        <strong class=\"sc-color-light\">IN PRODUCTION</strong> status. Once "
"production has started,\n"
"        no cancellations or refunds will be accepted, except for a "
"demonstrable manufacturing defect.\n"
"        "

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:176
msgid "Garantías"
msgstr "Warranties"

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:178
msgid ""
"\n"
"        SPACE CHEER garantiza que los productos entregados corresponderán a "
"las especificaciones\n"
"        del pedido aprobado. En caso de defecto de fabricación, el usuario "
"deberá notificarlo\n"
"        dentro de los 7 días naturales posteriores a la recepción del "
"pedido, adjuntando evidencia\n"
"        fotográfica. SPACE CHEER evaluará cada caso y determinará la "
"solución apropiada (reposición,\n"
"        reparación o crédito).\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        SPACE CHEER guarantees that delivered products will match the "
"specifications\n"
"        of the approved order. In case of a manufacturing defect, the user "
"must report it\n"
"        within 7 calendar days after receiving the order, attaching "
"photographic\n"
"        evidence. SPACE CHEER will evaluate each case and determine the "
"appropriate solution (replacement,\n"
"        repair, or credit).\n"
"        "

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:190
msgid "Protección de Datos de Menores de Edad"
msgstr "Protection of Minors' Data"

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:193
msgid ""
"\n"
"        SPACE CHEER maneja datos de menores de edad de conformidad con la\n"
"        <strong>Ley General de los Derechos de Niñas, Niños y Adolescentes "
"(LGDNNA)</strong>\n"
"        y la <strong>Ley Federal de Protección de Datos Personales en "
"Posesión de los\n"
"        Particulares (LFPDPPP)</strong>.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        SPACE CHEER handles data of minors in accordance with the\n"
"        <strong>General Law on the Rights of Girls, Boys, and Adolescents "
"(LGDNNA)</strong>\n"
"        and the <strong>Federal Law on the Protection of Personal Data Held "
"by\n"
"        Private Parties (LFPDPPP)</strong>.\n"
"        "

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:201
msgid ""
"\n"
"        El registro y tratamiento de datos personales de atletas menores de "
"18 años\n"
"        requiere el <strong class=\"sc-color-light\">consentimiento expreso "
"del padre, madre o\n"
"        tutor legal</strong> (en adelante \"el Tutor\"). Al registrar a un "
"menor en la Plataforma,\n"
"        el Tutor declara:\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        The registration and processing of personal data of athletes under "
"18 years old\n"
"        requires the <strong class=\"sc-color-light\">express consent of the "
"parent or\n"
"        legal guardian</strong> (hereinafter \"the Guardian\"). By "
"registering a minor on the Platform,\n"
"        the Guardian declares:\n"
"        "

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:209
msgid "Ser el padre, madre o tutor legal del menor."
msgstr "Being the minor's parent or legal guardian."

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:210
msgid ""
"Autorizar el tratamiento de los datos personales del menor, incluyendo "
"nombre, fecha de nacimiento, CURP y medidas corporales, para los fines de la "
"Plataforma."
msgstr ""
"Authorizing the processing of the minor's personal data, including name, "
"date of birth, CURP, and body measurements, for the Platform's purposes."

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:211
msgid "Que la información proporcionada es veraz y está actualizada."
msgstr "That the information provided is truthful and up to date."

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:212
msgid ""
"Comprender que puede revocar este consentimiento en cualquier momento, "
"solicitándolo a space.cheer.space@gmail.com."
msgstr ""
"Understanding that this consent may be revoked at any time by requesting it "
"at space.cheer.space@gmail.com."

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:215
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Los datos de menores están sujetos a controles adicionales de acceso "
"dentro de la\n"
"        Plataforma. Solo el personal autorizado del equipo (HEADCOACH, "
"COACH, STAFF) y el propio\n"
"        Tutor vinculado podrán consultar esta información.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Minors' data is subject to additional access controls within the\n"
"        Platform. Only authorized team personnel (HEADCOACH, COACH, STAFF) "
"and the\n"
"        linked Guardian may access this information.\n"
"        "

#: .\templates\core\terminos.html:222
msgid ""
"\n"
"        SPACE CHEER no compartirá datos de menores con terceros, salvo "
"obligación legal expresa.\n"
"        Los Tutores pueden ejercer los derechos ARCO (Acceso, Rectificación, "
"Cancelación y\n"
"        Oposición) enviando una solicitud a\n"
"        <a href=\"mailto:space.cheer.space@gmail.com\" class=\"sc-color-"
"cyan\">space.cheer.space@gmail.com</a>.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        SPACE CHEER will not share minors' data with third parties, except "
"when expressly required by law.\n"
"        Guardians may exercise their ARCO rights (Access, Rectification, "
"Cancellation, and\n"
"        Objection) by sending a request to\n"
"        <a href=\"mailto:space.cheer.space@gmail.com\" class=\"sc-color-"
"cyan\">space.cheer.space@gmail.com</a>.\n"
"        "

